  .job-card
        h3 Yamato Delivery Driver
        p This is a delivery driver job for Yamato. You will visit customers’ homes and deliver packages. The more deliveries you complete in a day, the more you can earn. (Although it is difficult at first, once you get used to it, you can deliver around 150 to 200 packages per day.)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Salary
           | 375,000–500,000 yen
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Position:
          | Light cargo driver
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Working hours:
           | 07:00–20:00 (finish once deliveries are completed)
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Holidays:
          | 6 days off per month
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Contract type:
           | Subcontract agreement
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Work location:
          | Chiba Prefecture (Ibaraki Prefecture also available upon request)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Training period:
           | Ends once you can deliver 150 packages or more
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Training daily pay:
          | 10,000 yen
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Eligible visas:
           | Permanent resident visa
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong Required license:
          | Regular driver’s license
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
          p
           strong Other:
           | Gasoline and vehicle costs will be deducted from salary
           br/
           | Salary increases depending on average monthly deliveries: e.g., 150 deliveries = 375,000 yen, 200 deliveries = 500,000 yen
         .col-sm-6
          p
          strong 
          

